second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which person or organization did Guillaume Fontaine work for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 91, \"text\": \"Here is a potential Wikipedia entry that presents comprehensive evidence for the statement:\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 93, \"end\": 111, \"text\": \"Guillaume Fontaine\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 113, \"end\": 227, \"text\": \"Guillaume Fontaine is a researcher who has made significant contributions to the field of cardiovascular research.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 228, \"end\": 380, \"text\": \"According to his ORCID ID, 0000-0002-7806-814X, Fontaine has published numerous papers and collaborated with various institutions throughout his career.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 381, \"end\": 387, \"text\": \"Career\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 389, \"end\": 518, \"text\": \"Fontaine has worked at the Montreal Heart Institute, a renowned hospital in Canada dedicated to cardiovascular care and research.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 519, \"end\": 667, \"text\": \"This affiliation is supported by multiple sources, including his ORCID profile, which lists the Montreal Heart Institute as one of his affiliations.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 668, \"end\": 671, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 673, \"end\": 810, \"text\": \"Additionally, a search of the Montreal Heart Institute's website reveals Fontaine's name among the list of researchers and staff members.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 811, \"end\": 1059, \"text\": \"[2] Furthermore, several research papers co-authored by Fontaine and published in reputable scientific journals, such as the Journal of the American College of Cardiology and Circulation, acknowledge the Montreal Heart Institute as his affiliation.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1060, \"end\": 1066, \"text\": \"[3][4]\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1068, \"end\": 1079, \"text\": \"References:\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1081, \"end\": 1091, \"text\": \"[1] ORCID.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1092, \"end\": 1099, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1100, \"end\": 1119, \"text\": \"Guillaume Fontaine.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1120, \"end\": 1177, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/orcid.org\\\\/0000-0002-7806-814X>\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1179, \"end\": 1208, \"text\": \"[2] Montreal Heart Institute.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1209, \"end\": 1216, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1217, \"end\": 1231, \"text\": \"Research Team.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1232, \"end\": 1305, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.icm-mhi.org\\\\/en\\\\/research\\\\/research-team\\\\/>\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1307, \"end\": 1331, \"text\": \"[3] Fontaine, G., et al.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1332, \"end\": 1339, \"text\": \"(2020).\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1340, \"end\": 1441, \"text\": \"Association of Cardiac Troponin with Cardiovascular Outcomes in Patients with Chronic Kidney Disease.\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1442, \"end\": 1507, \"text\": \"Journal of the American College of Cardiology, 75(11), 1331–1342.\"}, \"D1S25\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1508, \"end\": 1540, \"text\": \"doi: 10.1016\\\\/j.jacc.2020.02.052\"}, \"D1S26\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1542, \"end\": 1566, \"text\": \"[4] Fontaine, G., et al.\"}, \"D1S27\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1567, \"end\": 1574, \"text\": \"(2019).\"}, \"D1S28\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1575, \"end\": 1662, \"text\": \"Impact of Diabetes on Cardiovascular Outcomes in Patients with Acute Coronary Syndrome.\"}, \"D1S29\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1663, \"end\": 1695, \"text\": \"Circulation, 139(10), 1231–1242.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 17, \"text\": \"**Breaking News**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 19, \"end\": 135, \"text\": \"Renowned Researcher Guillaume Fontaine Joins University of Putra Malaysia, Boosting Institution's Scientific Profile\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 137, \"end\": 403, \"text\": \"Serdang, Selangor, Malaysia - In a significant development, the University of Putra Malaysia (UPM) has announced the appointment of esteemed researcher Guillaume Fontaine, further solidifying the institution's reputation as a hub for cutting-edge scientific inquiry.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 404, \"end\": 547, \"text\": \"Fontaine, a distinguished expert in his field, brings with him a wealth of experience and a impressive track record of groundbreaking research.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 548, \"end\": 715, \"text\": \"His ORCID ID, 0000-0002-7806-814X, boasts an impressive array of publications and collaborations, cementing his status as a leading authority in his area of expertise.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 716, \"end\": 747, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to welcome Dr.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 748, \"end\": 809, \"text\": \"Fontaine to our academic community,\\\" said Professor Dato' Dr.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 810, \"end\": 855, \"text\": \"Mohd Roslan Sulaiman, Vice-Chancellor of UPM.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 856, \"end\": 1010, \"text\": \"\\\"His exceptional credentials and passion for innovation will undoubtedly enrich our research landscape and inspire our students to strive for excellence.\\\"\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1011, \"end\": 1161, \"text\": \"Fontaine, who assumed his new role earlier this month, expressed his enthusiasm for the opportunity to contribute to UPM's vibrant research ecosystem.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1162, \"end\": 1343, \"text\": \"\\\"I am honored to join this esteemed institution and collaborate with talented colleagues who share my passion for advancing scientific knowledge,\\\" he said in an exclusive interview.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1344, \"end\": 1508, \"text\": \"\\\"The University of Putra Malaysia's commitment to excellence and its state-of-the-art facilities make it the ideal platform for me to pursue my research interests.\\\"\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1509, \"end\": 1704, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the university, Fontaine's appointment is expected to have a significant impact on UPM's research output, with several high-profile projects already in the pipeline.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1705, \"end\": 1856, \"text\": \"His expertise is anticipated to bolster the institution's research capabilities, particularly in the areas of sustainability and environmental science.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1857, \"end\": 2073, \"text\": \"Data released by the university reveals that Fontaine's arrival has already sparked a surge in research collaborations, with a 25% increase in international partnerships and a 30% rise in research grant applications.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2074, \"end\": 2078, \"text\": \"\\\"Dr.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2079, \"end\": 2157, \"text\": \"Fontaine's presence has created a buzz among our research community,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2158, \"end\": 2209, \"text\": \"Norhayati Abdullah, Dean of the Faculty of Science.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2210, \"end\": 2371, \"text\": \"\\\"His expertise and reputation have opened doors to new opportunities, and we are confident that his contributions will have a lasting impact on our institution.\\\"\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2372, \"end\": 2461, \"text\": \"As Fontaine settles into his new role, the academic community is abuzz with anticipation.\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2462, \"end\": 2600, \"text\": \"With his impressive credentials and UPM's commitment to excellence, the stage is set for a new era of scientific discovery and innovation.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Montreal Heart Institute\", \"University of Putra Malaysia\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Montreal Heart Institute\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"University of Putra Malaysia\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
